  "system": {
    "biography": "<p><strong>Stone is a full magician</strong>, not a gunman — the module previously shipped him as a byte-identical copy of Osprey, with Magic 0, no spells and an Uzi. He has nine spells, Sorcery 7, Magic Theory 8 and a printed <strong>Magic Pool of 7</strong>.</p><p><strong>Three bound elementals</strong> (separate actors in this compendium, and no link between them — the NPC data model has no boundSpirits field, so the assignment is recorded here rather than faked mechanically):</p><ul><li><strong>Fire Elemental Force 5</strong> — assigned to <em>Spell Defense</em>.</li><li><strong>Fire Elemental Force 4</strong> — bound to him, for <em>Combat Spells</em>.</li><li><strong>Earth Elemental Force 5</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Six expendable Manipulation fetishes.</strong> Armor, Control Thoughts and Petrify each need one to cast.</p><p><em>Queen Euphoria p.21, verified from a render.</em></p>",
