        "notes": "<p>REQUIRES A FETISH (printed).</p><p><em>Queen Euphoria conversion (core p.283 — translate spell codes). <strong>No SR2 equivalent — custom spell.</strong> NO SR2 EQUIVALENT EXISTS. Checked the core rulebook and Grimoire 2e: both have only 'Petrifying Gaze' as a critter power (basilisk, cockatrice), not a spell. Rather than drop one of Stone's three fetish-bound Manipulation spells — which would change the encounter — it is kept as a QE-local custom spell built on the SR1 printing and flagged as such on the item. This is the spell equivalent of weapon method B.</em></p>"
